{{!--
  API versioning strategy -- ADR output template for the "api-versioning" decision framework (11 §11.0's
  own execution contract: "produce a ranked recommendation... write an ADR"). Modelled field-for-field
  on packages/templates/templates/adr-repo-strategy.md.hbs -- the identical real, execution-data shape
  (not 19 §19.2's own TemplateContext; a framework's own output template renders against its own scoring
  run's execution data, per that file's own doc comment) every other real *.framework.yaml's own
  output_template in this codebase already renders against.

  Only Handlebars built-in helpers are used (#each, #if) -- no custom helper is registered anywhere in
  this repository yet, the same convention every other real .hbs template here already follows. Every
  triple-stash {{{ }}} is deliberate: a double-stash {{ }} HTML-escapes its value by Handlebars' own
  default, which would corrupt a YAML scalar containing an apostrophe or an ampersand -- this is a
  Markdown/YAML render target, not HTML. Every array field's own {{#each}} carries an {{else}} branch
  rendering a literal "[]", matching adr-repo-strategy.md.hbs's own reasoning: an empty {{#each}}
  renders nothing at all, which would otherwise leave the YAML key with no value (parses as null, not
  []) -- adrSchema's own array fields reject null.
--}}
---
id: ADR-{{seq}}
type: ADR
schemaVersion: 1
title: {{{title}}}
status: {{{status}}}
category: architecture
deciders:
{{#each deciders}}
  - {{{this}}}
{{else}}
  []
{{/each}}
date: {{{date}}}
created: {{{date}}}
updated: {{{date}}}
revision: 1
author: {{{author}}}
reversibility: {{{reversibility}}}
blast_radius:
{{#each blastRadius}}
  - {{{this}}}
{{else}}
  []
{{/each}}
revisit_trigger: {{{revisitTrigger}}}
supersedes:
{{#each supersedes}}
  - {{{this}}}
{{else}}
  []
{{/each}}
superseded_by: null
related:
{{#each related}}
  - {{{this}}}
{{else}}
  []
{{/each}}
diagrams:
{{#each diagrams}}
  - {{{this}}}
{{else}}
  []
{{/each}}
framework: api-versioning
changelog:
  - revision: 1
    date: {{{date}}}
    by: {{{author}}}
    summary: {{{changelogSummary}}}
---

